<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs steady/up $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs steady/up $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were steady to $0.50 higher in a forced market. Top $54.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2 230-260 lbs. 52.50-54.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/off $1.00. Top $47.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs. 40.00-42.00</p>
<p>	     450-500 lbs. 42.00-44.00</p>
<p>	     500-600 lbs. 44.00-45.00</p>
<p>	     few over 600 lbs. 45.00-47.00</p>
</text>
